@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
@accountId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Create Transaction - Credit (Crédito de R$ 100,00)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lancamentos
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: credit-test-{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": 0,
  "amount": 100.00,
  "idempotencyKey": "credit-test-{{$timestamp}}"
}

###

### Create Transaction - Debit (Débito de R$ 50,00)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lancamentos
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: debit-test-{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": 1,
  "amount": 50.00,
  "idempotencyKey": "debit-test-{{$timestamp}}"
}

###

### Create Transaction - Large Credit (Crédito de R$ 1000,00)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lancamentos
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: large-credit-{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": 0,
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "idempotencyKey": "large-credit-{{$timestamp}}"
}

###

### Test Idempotency - Same key should return cached response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lancamentos
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: idempotency-test-123

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": 0,
  "amount": 25.00,
  "idempotencyKey": "idempotency-test-123"
}

###

### Notes:
# - Type: 0 = Credit, 1 = Debit
# - Idempotency-Key ensures duplicate requests return the same response
# - AccountId needs to exist in database first
# - Use docker-compose to run dependencies (PostgreSQL, Redis, LocalStack)
